    {
      "id": "s1",
      "kind": "paper",
      "title": "Language Models are Unsupervised Multitask Learners",
      "url": "https://cdn.openai.com/better-language-models/language_models_are_unsupervised_multitask_learners.pdf",
      "version": "OpenAI 2019原發布PDF；SHA d9d852e2894556e73f53cb22b7c605a9643d6f0b19bf604b429ed6192fa24f4e",
      "verified": true,
      "checked_original": true,
      "accessed_on": "2026-10-03",
      "authority_reason": "OpenAI原作者發布的GPT-2技術報告，直接說明byte級BPE表示方法。",
      "inspection_note": "第3頁 §2.2 Input Representation；§2.3 Model；作者以UTF-8 bytes表示文字，對照 Unicode 碼點 BPE 與256項起始byte表；頻率驅動合併較常見片段，並用預切分阻止跨字類別合併。§2.2是表示工具，§2.3另建立 Transformer 語言模型；可表示任意有效 Unicode 字串不等於已學會語意或品質最佳。本文來源只支持一般byte級BPE概念，不支持本專案任何成績。",
      "download_sha256": "d9d852e2894556e73f53cb22b7c605a9643d6f0b19bf604b429ed6192fa24f4e",
      "artifact_id": "a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "kind": "official_source",
      "title": "Hugging Face tokenizers ByteLevel原始碼",
      "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/huggingface/tokenizers/88a4498ad4ea1a9487b0a9b0ff881383fd5a06a3/tokenizers/src/pre_tokenizers/byte_level.rs",
      "version": "tokenizers v0.23.2；commit 88a4498ad4ea1a9487b0a9b0ff881383fd5a06a3",
      "verified": true,
      "checked_original": true,
      "accessed_on": "2026-10-03",
      "authority_reason": "套件維護者官方repo，固定版本直接定義byte映射、prefix與decode。",
      "inspection_note": "L15–38、L93–95、L120–170；0..255各映至不同可见Unicode代號；alphabet 收集全部代號。prefix只在旗標為真而未以空格起始時補入。Regex分割仍保留片段；每Unicode碼點的原始UTF-8 bytes依序映射。Decoder將全部token字元逆映至bytes後一次轉字串；from_utf8_lossy意味生成非法bytes時可出替代符號，不能宣稱每個token單獨是完整字符或任意ID序列都合法。",
      "download_sha256": "f9b5a747a0ad936f0c49cff8f32bc8f166126704ab02d5af0505ad032fe6d99a",
      "artifact_id": "a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "kind": "official_source",
      "title": "Hugging Face tokenizers BPE trainer原始碼",
      "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/huggingface/tokenizers/88a4498ad4ea1a9487b0a9b0ff881383fd5a06a3/tokenizers/src/models/bpe/trainer.rs",
      "version": "tokenizers v0.23.2；commit 88a4498ad4ea1a9487b0a9b0ff881383fd5a06a3",
      "verified": true,
      "checked_original": true,
      "accessed_on": "2026-10-03",
      "authority_reason": "套件官方trainer，直接定義起始alphabet、頻率計數、停止條件及ID／merge rank。",
      "inspection_note": "L313–360、L414–624；initial_alphabet各符號會加入；本例limit_alphabet未設，故不會刪byte符號。特殊token先加入詞表，起始符號再按碼點排序分配ID。每項內相鄰對按出現次數加權；依佇列最高次數合併，詞表達目標、無可合併對或低於min_frequency就停止。新片段由左右項拼接，合併順序以rank保存。vocab_size先作合併停止條件，不會縮掉已加入的完整alphabet；故設10仍可實得256。",
      "download_sha256": "c018495f81488938d68ce5e7e247af28db3969b83635929eff73852e15d0c7ba",
      "artifact_id": "a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "kind": "official_source",
      "title": "Hugging Face Tokenizer pipeline／序列化原始碼",
      "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/huggingface/tokenizers/88a4498ad4ea1a9487b0a9b0ff881383fd5a06a3/tokenizers/src/tokenizer/mod.rs",
      "version": "tokenizers v0.23.2；commit 88a4498ad4ea1a9487b0a9b0ff881383fd5a06a3",
      "verified": true,
      "checked_original": true,
      "accessed_on": "2026-10-03",
      "authority_reason": "套件官方pipeline，直接定義可選normalizer、decode、train與save。",
      "inspection_note": "L568–580、L935–952、L1513–1536、L1621–1637；new的normalizer、pre/postprocessor、decoder為None；本例只安裝ByteLevel前處理與decoder。decode先用ID查token，可按skip_special_tokens略過特殊項，再傳decoder。train執行前處理後餵trainer並更新model，沒有神經模型參數更新。save序列化整份規則到JSON。",
      "download_sha256": "38e8a0755d0c1c627bf532a28d6030413ee719c855fb1a807e1d3a647b62d56c",
      "artifact_id": "a7"
    },
