      "inspection_note": "L656–669、L846–860、L1248–1257、L1296–1316；Python介面確認list[str]可作訓練iterator；Tokenizer pipeline先normalizer，再pre_tokenizer，再模型查token/ID與postprocessor。save是JSON序列化API。",
      "download_sha256": "26c44941975c33cb04f86c04028355c164fdd56eef2a894cb088fefa1d88aab8",
